{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "bc4f9d8d-e573-8e08-b732-ae1abb7650ea",
  "created_at": "2026-01-21T14:17:49-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Recreation",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Alan J. Thurston",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Beth Almeida",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T14:15:42-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Recreation Department, this is Beth, good afternoon! How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T14:15:47-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Beth. I'm calling about a swing at one of the playgrounds. One of the seats is busted, the chain's come loose on one side and it's just hanging there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T14:15:59-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, thanks for letting us know. Which playground is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T14:16:04-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The one down by the beach, the little one past the bathhouse. By the bubbler, the water fountain, you know, the one that's usually shut off this time of year."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T14:16:15-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so the beach park playground near the bathhouse. And it's the swing set, one seat with a loose chain?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T14:16:23-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. The far swing on the left. Somebody could get hurt if a little kid hops on it. I was walking by with my son and noticed it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T14:16:34-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good catch. I'll put in a work order and our parks crew will take a look and tape it off or take the seat down if they need to. Is there a number in case somebody needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T14:16:49-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, it's 401-555-0198."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T14:16:51-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0198. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T14:16:54-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alan Thurston. T-H-U-R-S-T-O-N."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T14:16:56-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect, Alan. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T14:16:58-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "My boy wanted to stay and swing, of course. He's been on me all week about some sneakers that cost more than my first car. I said no. So he was already in a mood."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T14:17:11-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, at least the swing gives him something free to complain about. I'll get this entered today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T14:17:18-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And if this doesn't work out, say it sits there broken for a couple weeks, who do I go to after you? Do I just call back here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T14:17:29-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, call back here and mention the work order, and I can check on it. If it still isn't getting anywhere, ask for the department director's office and they can follow up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T14:17:41-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, that works. Thanks, Beth."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T14:17:44-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Alan. Have a good afternoon!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T14:17:47-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too."
    }
  ],
